WEBVTT

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.016
(Kicheko)

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.656
Akasema, "Nipe kidogo."
Nikasema, "L-A. La."

00:04:33.656 --> 00:04:34.776
(Kicheko)

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.216
Ilikuwa babukubwa.

00:04:36.240 --> 00:04:39.416
Yaani, sasa naweza, kwa mara ya kwanza
katika maisha yangu, kusoma.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:41.480
Hisia niliyoipata, ni ya kustaajabu sana.

00:04:43.240 --> 00:04:45.840
Kisha, nikiwa na miaka 22, 
nikijisikia mwenyewe,

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.536
nikijiamini,

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:50.400
Nilikumbuka kile yule mzee aliniambia.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:55.496
Kwa hiyo nilichukua 
kurasa za biashara za gazeti.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.456
Nilitaka kuwatafuta hawa matajiri weupe.

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.080
(Kicheko)